        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "One rare huge variant inflates every value",
            "Box it: `Big(Box<HugeStruct>)` shrinks the rest",
            "Clippy `large_enum_variant` fires on the imbalance",
            "Fix is boxing — the match arms stay as they are"
