          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Wildcards And Alternatives"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`_` matches anything and binds nothing",
            "A bare name `other` matches AND binds it",
            "Or-patterns: `1 | 2 | 3 => \"small\"`",
            "Every alternative must bind the same names and types"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Ranges And Guards"
        },
